    "limitation_zh": "该人物仅用于检查服务旅程和回执结构，不代表任何真实个人、群体规模、用户偏好、需求频率或调研结论。",
    "limitation_en": "This persona exists only to test the service journey and receipt structure. It represents no actual person, population size, preference distribution, demand frequency, or research finding.",
    "mobility_limitation_zh": "轮椅使用仅是检验无障碍通行、服务台与人工接管界面的合成设计条件，不是观察到的真实人物或群体特征，也不是实地调研结论。",
    "mobility_limitation_en": "Wheelchair use is a synthetic condition for testing accessible circulation, the service desk, and the human-takeover interface. It is not an observed trait of an actual person or population and is not a field-research finding."
